<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.generic-resource-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC3>
  Fabric平台 的 App 能力迁移时，通用资源管理由谁拥有？
  </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC3>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC4>
    必须复用 halfcode-compiler.xnl，不能复制 Fabric平台 的早期资源管理器。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC4>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC5>
    ResourcePackage、Catalog、KindDefinition、ResourceTree、identity/ref、layering、revision/provenance 与 SkillCapsule distribution 统一由 Halfcode 拥有；depa-flows 和 Eidolon 只能消费 normalized public facts。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC5>
    <rationale ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC6>
    避免出现第二套 scanner/catalog/overlay/installer authority，并与 Codument 新版消费 Halfcode 的模式一致。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC6>
    <evidence ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC7>
    用户明确约束；Halfcode resource-core、application-assembly 与 SkillCapsule compiler；Fabric平台 ResourceRegistry 只作为迁移证据。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC7>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.workflow-domain-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC8>
  AI Workflow、Agent 与 Material 的资源语义应落在哪个项目？
  </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC8>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC9>
    只有 workflow 相关内容放入 depa-flows.ts，其他资源类型必须留在各自 owner 项目。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VC9>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCA>
    depa-flows 拥有 AICtrlWorkflow、AIDataWorkflow、AIAgentDefinition、agent task、ordered messages、MaterialPort/Binding 和 run freeze 的 Kind contract/consumer projection；它不拥有通用 package/catalog。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCA>
    <rationale ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCB>
    领域语义与通用资源机制必须分离，才能让其他项目复用 Halfcode 且不依赖 AI Workflow。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCB>
    <evidence ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCC>
    用户边界；现有 depa-flows packages/docs；Halfcode normalized ResourceRecord contract。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCC>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.system-skill-topology apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCD>
  原 sys-ai-workflow 应怎样拆分？
  </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCD>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCE>
    建立 DevOps 总 Skill、独立 authoring Skill 和独立 run Skill。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCE>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCF>
    安装 `sys-eidolon-anchor-devops`、`sys-eidolon-anchor-authoring`、`sys-eidolon-anchor-run`；DevOps 的 Code 阶段引用 authoring，Deploy/Operate/Monitor 阶段引用 run。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCF>
    <rationale ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCG>
    对齐 ACE Workbench 的生命周期路由与独立 authoring 结构，同时保留 develop/run 的产品阶段隔离。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCG>
    <evidence ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCH>
    用户确认的名称和职责；ACE sibling Skill delegation；Fabric平台 develop/run skills。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCH>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.resource-dsl-skill apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCJ>
  是否需要一个对标 flow-xml-dsl 的 XNL Resource DSL Skill？
  </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCJ>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCK>
    需要，但它应由 Halfcode 所有，不应成为另一个 Eidolon 私有标准。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCK>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCM>
    Halfcode 从 canonical resource-dsl docs 和 SkillCapsule 生成 `sys-halfcode-resource-dsl`；它只拥有语言规范和静态诊断，不拥有 Eidolon authoring operations。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCM>
    <rationale ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCN>
    通用 XNL 资源语法服务多个 consumer，独立 Skill 能保持 authority、复用和渐进加载边界。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCN>
    <evidence ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCP>
    Halfcode framework-resource-dsl 与 docs/resource-dsl 已形成标准真源，但现有仓库维护 Skill 不适合作为安装制品。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCP>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.operations-terminology apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P1" } (
  <question ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCQ>
  专属 Skill 中结构化操作目录使用什么名称？
  </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCQ>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCR>
    使用 operations/，不用 actions/。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCR>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCS>
    authoring 与 run Skill 的操作协议统一放在 `operations/`；DevOps 生命周期阶段仍使用独立 stage 目录。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCS>
    <rationale ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCT>
    operations 同时覆盖 inspect、plan、apply、validate、start、resume 和 observe，比 actions 更准确。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCT>
    <evidence ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCV>
    用户明确修正。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCV>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.generated-domain-references apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCW>
  Flow DSL 和其他 Kind 规范怎样进入 authoring Skill？
  </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCW>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCX>
    通过 Halfcode 编译为 references，必须携带来源和版本，不能在 Eidolon 手工维护副本。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCX>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCY>
    authoring Skill 只声明所需标准资源；Halfcode ResourceMappings/SkillCapsule 从 owner 项目生成 references，并写入 source FQN、apiVersion、content digest 与 provenance。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCY>
    <rationale ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCZ>
    既支持离线渐进加载，又避免 copied docs 漂移成第二事实源。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VCZ>
    <evidence ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD0>
    用户确认；Halfcode SkillCapsule Includes、ResourceMappings 与 deterministic compiler。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD0>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.eidolon-host-boundary apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD1>
  Eidolon 在 Resource-native App 架构中拥有什么？
  </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD1>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD2>
    Eidolon 保留安装入口、资源消费 adapter 和现有 actor/runtime。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD2>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD3>
    Eidolon 拥有 `~/.eidolon`/workspace binding、`global init` staged installation、system authority、TUI/CLI/native tools 与 AgentRegistry/actor/provider/tool/session runtime；资源与 workflow 语义分别来自 Halfcode 和 depa-flows。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD3>
    <rationale ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD4>
    保持 host effect 和产品 surface 内聚，同时拒绝平行资源编译器或 workflow-specific agent runtime。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD4>
    <evidence ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD5>
    既有 Eidolon architecture attractors；用户要求只维护一个 eidolon 程序并复用底层通用机制。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD5>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.system-skill-versioning apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P1" } (
  <question ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD6>
  新系统 Skill 如何版本化并迁移旧 Skill？
  </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD6>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD7>
    使用 1.0.&lt;patch&gt;，只增长小版本。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD7>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD8>
    四个新 Skill 以各自新 identity 从 `1.0.0` 开始，只允许 `1.0.x`；global init 在新 closure 完整 readback 后移除旧 `sys-ai-workflow`，失败时保留上一完整安装集。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD8>
    <rationale ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD9>
    独立 identity 不继承旧单体 Skill 的 patch 数；原子迁移避免双 authority 和部分升级。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VD9>
    <evidence ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDA>
    用户版本约束；当前 system skill installer 与 global init 行为。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDA>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.no-fuzzy-host-semantics apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDB>
  资源 Kind、stage、topology 和业务操作由谁从自然语言决定？
  </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDB>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDC>
    由模型和系统 Skill 决定，host 代码不得模糊匹配。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDC>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDD>
    模型读取 DevOps/authoring/run 与领域 references 后提交结构化选择；host 只校验显式 Kind、stage、operation、revision、resource ref、receipt 和 authorization，禁止 regex、keyword、substring 或 ordered heuristic。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDD>
    <rationale ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDE>
    语义判断属于 AI 控制面，确定性代码只拥有可判定 transition 和安全边界。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDE>
    <evidence ?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDF>
    用户原则性约束；eidolon-ai-workflow-native-capability behavior。
    </?01M05F1P506EXRVHCRT75Q9VDF>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.complete-agent-definition-runtime apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?>`AIAgentDefinition` 的完整支持以什么作为完成边界？</?>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?>所有标准字段必须进入通用 runtime 执行，并与 Ctrl/Data workflow 端到端可用。</?>
    <decision-text ?>depa-flows SHALL own closed executable schema、effect-policy、Material delivery projections；Eidolon SHALL enforce them through generic Agent/actor/tool/session mechanisms for both AICtrlWorkflow and AIDataWorkflow. A standard declared contract MUST NOT be treated as a successful unsupported profile.</?>
    <rationale ?>只冻结引用却拒绝或不交付其语义，会让 ResourcePackage 声明与真实运行能力不一致，也不能满足预制 App 的产品目标。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户于 2026-08-22 明确要求“完整支持 AIAgentDefinition”和 Ctrl/Data workflow 集成及 E2E 可用；现有 adapter 对 schema/effect policy 明确 fail closed，Material 仅进入 freeze receipt。</?>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.definition-instance-run-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?>AI Workflow 的 definition、instance、run 与各类 state 应由什么结构拥有？</?>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?>恢复 depa-flows 已继承的 Definition→Instance→Run 设计，不能在 Eidolon 中按事实类型重新发明平行目录。</?>
    <decision-text ?>depa-flows SHALL own a Definition→frozen Instance→Run envelope. A run-local checkpoint SHALL be the single live authority for input, config, state, output, controller/node sidecars and profile durable state. Eidolon SHALL only bind a storage support implementation and SHALL NOT create parallel writable Ctrl, Data or AI state authorities.</?>
    <rationale ?>Python fixture/host persistence 与 depa order-fulfillment 已证明完整 bundle 物化、seed/config/state 和 run-local checkpoint 是同一设计谱系；当前 Eidolon flat WorkflowFactStore 破坏了 instance 聚合与可恢复性。</?>
    <evidence ?>当前任务 2026-08-22 用户修正；Python multistep fixture、workspace_layout/process_persistence/FileFlowRunStore；depa flow-instance behavior、materializeInstance、order-fulfillment；Eidolon WorkflowFactStore。</?>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.agent-invocation-processors apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?>Agent 调用的底层 Processor 与 authored runtime facade 应使用什么 API？</?>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?>底层必须保留 runtime 首参，API 名统一为 runAgent 和 runTargetedAgent；便捷 facade 只能由 bootstrap 绑定 runtime。</?>
    <decision-text ?>The canonical processors SHALL be runAgent(agentRuntime,input,config) and runTargetedAgent(agentRuntime,selector,invocation,config). A runtime-bound facade MAY hide agentRuntime but SHALL retain the same method names. Generic invoke MAY remain internal and SHALL NOT be the authored Flow API.</?>
    <rationale ?>保持 DEPA 两种 Processor 公式、显式 effect runtime 与类型推导，同时提供不暴露 generic effect envelope 的 authoring DX。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户连续修正 runtime.ai.effects.agent、runtime-first Processor、target selector 与最终命名；DEPA Effect/Processor/invocation attractors；当前 ai-workflow-logic effects.invoke。</?>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.agent-instance-selector-state apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?>跨 Ctrl/Data 节点复用 Agent instance 时怎样寻址，引用由谁持久化？</?>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?>selector 使用 byInstanceId 或 byInstanceName；Eidolon session/instance refs 存进同一 Flow run 的系统级 profile state。</?>
    <decision-text ?>AIAgentSelector SHALL be a closed mutually-exclusive union with byInstanceId or byInstanceName. instanceName SHALL be unique within one Flow run; both keys, missing or empty keys, unresolved selectors and conflicting indexes SHALL fail closed without creating a new Agent instance. The AI Workflow profile SHALL own run-local id/name indexes in the canonical checkpoint and SHALL persist only opaque stable Eidolon actor/session/instance references and receipts, never conversation history or actor state.</?>
    <rationale ?>后续节点需要稳定、可恢复的实例寻址，但实际 actor/session authority仍属于 Eidolon 通用 runtime；Flow 只拥有引用和领域级复用绑定。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户明确的 selector DX、Flow system state 与同父目录要求；DEPA targets/invocation 边界；现有 generic Agent execution lifecycle。</?>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.legacy-workflow-fact-migration apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?>Eidolon 现有 flat WorkflowFactStore 怎样迁移到 depa-native instance/run store？</?>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?>旧事实只能兼容读取或一次性迁移；新布局单写，绝不能两套 store 同时成为 authority。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Eidolon SHALL provide a durable idempotent one-way migration or explicit legacy reader. New executions SHALL write only the depa-owned checkpoint model. Legacy and new stores SHALL NOT be dual-written, and interrupted migration SHALL resume without creating a second run or losing historical recovery.</?>
    <rationale ?>双写会让 Ctrl snapshot、Data RunGraph、Agent refs 和 receipt发生不可裁决漂移；历史 run 又不能因纠偏失去恢复能力。</?>
    <evidence ?>当前 WorkflowFactStore flat roots、已完成 Ctrl/Data recovery tests、用户要求保留 depa storage design。</?>
  )>
)>

<decision #mission.establish-eidolon-anchor-resource-native-app-and-skills.historical-evidence-scope apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P1" } (
  <question ?>本轮恢复历史设计时，哪些材料可以作为证据并怎样防止再次因压缩丢失？</?>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?>只使用指定 Python fixture/host persistence 与 depa-flows examples；把结论写入 mission、track、behavior 和 tests，不依赖聊天。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Planning SHALL distill the specified Python workflow evidence and depa-flows canonical examples into self-contained mission and track artifacts. Other translation projects SHALL NOT override these facts. Each implementation track SHALL promote relevant invariants into behavior deltas and executable acceptance cases.</?>
    <rationale ?>连续对话压缩曾让关键设计退化成 host 私有实现；四层持久证据能让后续 agent在无聊天上下文时恢复正确期望态。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户 2026-08-22 明确限定参考范围并要求从持久会话记录挖掘、固化。</?>
  )>
)>
